00:08:18,947 --> 00:08:24,947
Clean, Shaven is a drama, crime, thriller film directed by Lodge Kerrigan.

3
00:12:28,421 --> 00:12:34,421
Peter Winter is a young schizophrenic who is desperately trying to
get his daughter back from her adoptive family.

4
00:16:37,894 --> 00:16:43,894
He attempts to function in a world that, for him, is filled with strange voices,
electrical noise, disconcerting images, and jarringly sudden emotional shifts.

5
00:20:47,368 --> 00:20:53,368
During his quest, he runs afoul of the law and an ongoing murder investigation.

6
